From f5fbff32b7e6c2017335dbe019d1e7a4d1befc2d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: wine-thumbs <wine-thumbs@localhost>
Date: Fri, 18 Sep 2026 20:56:45 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 7/7] comdlg32: Add an address box and New folder and View
 buttons to the item dialog.

The item dialog did not show which folder it was in. It now has an
address box that follows navigation and takes a path to go to, a New
folder button and a view menu with Thumbnails, List and Details. The
dialog also opens with the size the user last gave it.
---
